      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 61,
      "containerId": "g1",
      "originalText": "G1 DTW distance <= T   (hard gate)\nwhole hand pose over time\n(dynamic time warping; T at least 2.0)",
